[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reads the six durable TUI/launch perf JSONL logs with bounded tail [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reads, aggregates them over a caller-supplied window into one composite [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]wire payload, and exposes it as the `perf_logs_query` Python binding.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Python perf facade and view model[/bold #D7AFFF]                             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]stats_facade[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core_perf_logs[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]stats_facade: add the thin `sase.stats` adapter that calls the new Rust [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]binding, fans out the fixed telemetry-store query set, and builds one [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]immutable presentation-ready PerfView with status grading and coverage [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]notes.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Perf view registration and interaction[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]perf_view[dim] · [dim][/dim]after stats_facade[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]perf_view: register Perf as the eighth Statistics view — tab strip, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]numbered selection, description, legends, grouping modes, non-project [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]scope, lazy loading, and the contextual help methodology section.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Perf view rendering[/bold #D7AFFF]                                           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]perf_render[dim] · [dim][/dim]after perf_view[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]perf_render: build the Perf renderable — the five hero tiles, the TUI [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]startup and stall panels, the grouped latency table, the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]data-and-instrumentation strip, and every degraded, partial, and empty [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]state.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Visual snapshots and documentation[/bold #D7AFFF]                            [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]perf_visuals[dim] · [dim][/dim]after perf_render[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]perf_visuals: add the PNG visual snapshots and their fixtures for the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]populated, narrow, and telemetry-disabled Perf states, and document the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]view in the ACE performance runbook.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-mj","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.5","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-mj.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-8bf0166e78b06053005821bc2d66afdb","started_at":"2026-08-16T00:28:30.185247+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[{"committed_at":1786852130,"sha":"9a3a8617cac79b79217520fbc5ba8c33bde5f17b","subject":"feat(ace): render the Statistics Perf dashboard"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"ffa136eb642d56908c1847460e4deb5f0ed576f630fdee17cc4dd762669d6ebb","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-mj.4/commits.json","size_bytes":225},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-mj.4/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"43673cec8b07b0579d025bae5ea780044faafaa2c9baed628bdc031d4665c2fa","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-mj.4/meta.json","size_bytes":664},"prompt":{"digest":"285e26ac0ccb37e104c507e8ae91ebb0d4be4708ea2401cd2be3d207d3526d3d","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-mj.4/prompt.md","size_bytes":141},"state":{"digest":"e1f328552fd8852e694d6188335fc1f63febd3fc66d0a9a6bbb123337e0711cf","path"